  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labgar Sheep Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to enable the group to establish a farm where sheep are bought and collectively fattened and maintained. In addition to farm construction; the fund will provide inputs and equipment for the farm and training for the members to secure the sustainability of the organization.</narrative>
  </description>
